    "A teammate's shared agent runs the task on their Mac, which pays for it. Only the task text leaves this Mac; the step takes the answer as {{nodes.<id>.output.text}}." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der geteilte Agent eines Teammitglieds erledigt die Aufgabe auf dessen Mac, der dafür bezahlt. Nur der Aufgabentext verlässt diesen Mac; der Schritt nimmt die Antwort als {{nodes.<id>.output.text}}."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A teammate's shared agent runs the task on their Mac, which pays for it. Only the task text leaves this Mac; the step takes the answer as {{nodes.<id>.output.text}}."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "팀원의 공유 에이전트가 팀원의 Mac에서 작업을 실행하며 비용도 그쪽이 부담합니다. 작업 텍스트만 이 Mac을 떠나며, 단계는 답변을 {{nodes.<id>.output.text}}로 받습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Общий агент коллеги выполняет задачу на его Mac, который за это платит. Этот Mac покидает только текст задачи; шаг получает ответ как {{nodes.<id>.output.text}}."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "队友的共享智能体在其 Mac 上运行任务并承担费用。只有任务文本会离开此 Mac；该步骤以 {{nodes.<id>.output.text}} 获取回答。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隊友的共享智能體在其 Mac 上執行任務並負擔費用。只有任務文字會離開此 Mac；此步驟以 {{nodes.<id>.output.text}} 取得回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
