    },
    "An osk-v1 key wraps /secure/call around /agents/.../run or dispatch. It is not the inbound webhook secret — inbound stays bearer-exempt and secret-verified." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein osk-v1-Schlüssel wrappt /secure/call um /agents/.../run oder dispatch. Er ist nicht das Inbound-Webhook-Geheimnis — Inbound bleibt bearer-frei und geheimnisverifiziert."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "osk-v1 키는 /agents/.../run 또는 dispatch를 /secure/call로 감쌉니다. 인바운드 웹훅 시크릿이 아닙니다. 인바운드는 계속 bearer 면제이며 시크릿으로 검증됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ключ osk-v1 оборачивает /agents/.../run или dispatch в /secure/call. Это не секрет входящего вебхука — вход по-прежнему без bearer и с проверкой секрета."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "osk-v1 密钥用 /secure/call 包装 /agents/.../run 或 dispatch。它不是入站 Webhook 密钥 — 入站仍免 bearer 并由密钥验证。"
          }
        }
      }
