    "Answers: replies to messages here. Posts on its own: may start a message here, in the rooms the bot may post in. Instructions, rooms and aliases are under More options." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antwortet: reagiert auf Nachrichten hier. Postet selbstständig: darf hier in den Räumen, in denen der Bot posten darf, selbst eine Nachricht beginnen. Anweisungen, Räume und Aliasse stehen unter Weitere Optionen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "답장: 여기의 메시지에 답합니다. 자체 게시: 봇이 게시할 수 있는 방에서 먼저 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다. 지시문, 방, 별칭은 더 많은 옵션에 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отвечает: реагирует на сообщения здесь. Публикует сам: может начать сообщение в комнатах, где боту разрешено писать. Инструкции, комнаты и псевдонимы — в разделе «Ещё»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答：回复此处的消息。自行发布：可在机器人允许发布的房间中主动发消息。指令、房间和别名在“更多选项”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answers: replies to messages here. To let an agent post on its own, allow the bot to post in a room first. Instructions, rooms and aliases are under More options." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
