    },
    "Changes save automatically, and receive polling starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. The first poll only arms the cursor — it does not replay old messages. Send a fresh message mentioning the bot in a readable channel, then watch each stage appear here." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use the \"Verify incoming message\" button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receive polling starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. The first poll only arms the cursor — it does not replay old messages. Send a fresh message mentioning the bot in a readable channel, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receive polling starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. The first poll only arms the cursor — it does not replay old messages. Send a fresh message mentioning the bot in a readable channel, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receive polling starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. The first poll only arms the cursor — it does not replay old messages. Send a fresh message mentioning the bot in a readable channel, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "更改自动保存，接收轮询在连接和访问完成后开始。第一次轮询仅激活游标 — 不会回放旧消息。在可读频道中发送一条提及机器人的新消息，然后在此处观察每个阶段出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "更改自動儲存，接收輪詢在連線和訪問完成後開始。第一次輪詢僅啟動遊標 — 不會播放舊訊息。在可讀頻道中傳送一條提及機器人的新訊息，然後在此處觀察每個階段出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once an account, Receive Mail and an allowed sender are set. Send mail from an allowed sender to a watched mailbox, press Check Now, then watch each stage appear here." : {

    },
    "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Conversations are complete. Send a WhatsApp message from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the WhatsApp verification process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Änderungen werden automatisch gespeichert, und der Empfang startet, sobald Verbinden und Unterhaltungen abgeschlossen sind. Sende eine WhatsApp-Nachricht von einem autorisierten Absender in einem lesbaren Chat und beobachte, wie hier jede Stufe erscheint."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "변경 사항은 자동으로 저장되며, 연결과 대화 설정이 완료되면 수신이 시작됩니다. 읽기 가능한 채팅에서 승인된 발신자가 WhatsApp 메시지를 보내면 각 단계가 여기에 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Изменения сохраняются автоматически, а приём начинается после завершения разделов «Подключение» и «Беседы». Отправьте сообщение WhatsApp от авторизованного отправителя в читаемом чате и наблюдайте, как здесь появляется каждый этап."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改会自动保存，完成“连接”和“会话”设置后即开始接收。请让已授权的发送者在可读聊天中发送一条 WhatsApp 消息，然后在此查看每个阶段的进展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Conversations are complete. Send yourself an iMessage from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the verification process for receiving iMessages.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Änderungen werden automatisch gespeichert, und der Empfang startet, sobald „Verbinden“ und „Unterhaltungen“ abgeschlossen sind. Sende dir selbst eine iMessage von einem autorisierten Absender in einem lesbaren Chat und beobachte hier, wie jede Stufe erscheint."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "변경 사항은 자동으로 저장되며, 연결과 대화 설정이 완료되면 수신이 시작됩니다. 읽기 가능한 채팅에서 승인된 발신자로 자신에게 iMessage를 보낸 뒤, 각 단계가 여기에 표시되는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Изменения сохраняются автоматически, а приём начинается после завершения разделов «Подключение» и «Беседы». Отправьте себе iMessage от авторизованного отправителя в доступном для чтения чате и наблюдайте, как здесь появляется каждый этап."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改会自动保存；完成“连接”和“对话”后即开始接收。请从可读聊天中的授权发送者向自己发送一条 iMessage，然后在此观察每个阶段的出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "變更會自動儲存；完成「連接」和「對話」後即開始接收。請從可讀聊天中的授權傳送者向自己傳送一則 iMessage，然後在此觀察每個階段的出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. Send the bot any message from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. Send the bot any message from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. Send the bot any message from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Changes save automatically, and receiving starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. Send the bot any message from an authorized sender in a readable chat, then watch each stage appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "更改会自动保存，连接和访问完成后即开始接收。以授权发送者身份，在可读聊天中向机器人发送任意消息，然后在此处观察每个阶段出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "更改自動儲存，接收在連線和訪問完成後開始。從可讀聊天中向機器人傳送任何來自授權傳送者的訊息，然後在此處觀察每個階段出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes save automatically, and Socket Mode receive starts once Connect and Receiving are complete. Send the test message below in an allowlisted channel from an authorized sender, then watch each stage appear here." : {
