    "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Appearance tab, where each agent can also override this voice." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the generative greetings feature, explaining its purpose and how to use it.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Appearance tab, where each agent can also override this voice."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Appearance tab, where each agent can also override this voice."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Appearance tab, where each agent can also override this voice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 生成问候语与快捷操作的默认风格。在智能体的外观标签页中为每个智能体单独开启问候语，各智能体也可覆盖此风格。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 生成問候語和快速操作的默認語音。在代理的外觀選項卡中按代理開啓問候語，每個代理也可以覆蓋此語音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Features tab; each agent can also override this voice in its Customization tab." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Default voice for AI-generated greetings + quick actions. Turn greetings on per agent under the agent's Features tab; each agent can also override this voice in its Customization tab."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI가 생성한 인사말 및 빠른 작업을 위한 기본 음성입니다. 에이전트의 기능 탭에서 에이전트별로 인사말을 켜세요. 각 에이전트는 맞춤 설정 탭에서 이 음성을 재정의할 수도 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Голос по умолчанию для приветствий, созданных с помощью ИИ, + быстрые действия. Включите приветствия для каждого агента на вкладке «Функции» агента; каждый агент также может отменить этот голос на вкладке «Настройка»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 生成问候语与快捷操作的默认风格。在智能体的“功能”标签页下为每个智能体单独开启问候语；各智能体也可在“自定义”标签页中覆盖此风格。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI生成問候語和快捷操作的默認語音。在智能體的\"功能\"標籤下爲每個智能體開啓問候語；每個智能體也可以在\"自定義\"標籤中覆蓋此語音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default: n8n Wait + GET the poll_url from the 202. Optional push below posts to an n8n Webhook trigger." : {
