    "Deletes all saved conversation data from disk, including leftover files from an interrupted write. Your chats are not affected — the next reply just takes a little longer to start." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Deletes every stored prompt checkpoint, including orphaned files left by an interrupted write. Chats keep working; the next turn re-prefills instead of resuming." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Deletes files" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löscht Dateien"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일 삭제"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Удаляет файлы"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes the Linux system and every agent's environment, including apk packages, then downloads the runtime and sets the sandbox up again. Kept: every agent's home folder (its files, SOUL.md, and pip and npm packages) and the shared folder. Workflows with dependencies will ask to install them again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löscht das Linux-System und die Umgebung jedes Agenten einschließlich der apk-Pakete, lädt dann die Laufzeit herunter und richtet die Sandbox neu ein. Erhalten bleiben: der Home-Ordner jedes Agenten (seine Dateien, SOUL.md sowie pip- und npm-Pakete) und der geteilte Ordner. Workflows mit Abhängigkeiten fragen erneut nach deren Installation."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linux 시스템과 apk 패키지를 포함한 모든 에이전트의 환경을 삭제한 다음 런타임을 다운로드하고 샌드박스를 다시 설정합니다. 유지되는 항목: 모든 에이전트의 홈 폴더(파일, SOUL.md, pip 및 npm 패키지)와 공유 폴더. 종속성이 있는 워크플로는 다시 설치를 요청합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Удаляет систему Linux и окружение каждого агента, включая пакеты apk, затем загружает среду выполнения и заново настраивает песочницу. Сохраняются: домашняя папка каждого агента (его файлы, SOUL.md и пакеты pip и npm) и общая папка. Рабочие процессы с зависимостями снова попросят их установить."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 Linux 系统和每个智能体的环境（包括 apk 软件包），然后下载运行时并重新设置沙盒。保留：每个智能体的主文件夹（其文件、SOUL.md 以及 pip 和 npm 软件包）和共享文件夹。带依赖项的工作流会再次请求安装依赖项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes this Mac's copy of every chat and its sync keys. Your other devices keep theirs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löscht die Kopie aller Chats und die Sync-Schlüssel auf diesem Mac. Deine anderen Geräte behalten ihre."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에 있는 모든 채팅 사본과 동기화 키를 삭제합니다. 다른 기기의 채팅은 그대로 남습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Удаляет копию всех чатов и ключи синхронизации на этом Mac. На других устройствах чаты останутся."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除此 Mac 上所有聊天的副本及其同步密钥。你的其他设备会保留它们的副本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除此 Mac 上所有聊天的副本及其同步金鑰。你的其他裝置會保留它們的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting a chat always deletes its file history." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Löschen eines Chats wird sein Dateiverlauf immer mitgelöscht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
