    "Docker Desktop on this Mac forwards host.docker.internal over loopback, so it counts as a same-Mac caller." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker Desktop auf diesem Mac leitet host.docker.internal über Loopback weiter und zählt daher als Aufruf vom selben Mac."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac의 Docker Desktop은 host.docker.internal을 루프백으로 전달하므로 같은 Mac의 호출로 취급됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker Desktop на этом Mac пересылает host.docker.internal через loopback, поэтому это считается вызовом с того же Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Mac 上的 Docker Desktop 通过回环转发 host.docker.internal，因此视为本机调用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Docker Desktop reaches this Mac as host.docker.internal; it counts as a same-Mac caller." : {
