          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each helper is off by default. Turn one on to set it up." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the \"Subagents\" tab in the Agent Detail View, explaining that each helper is off by default and that turning one on allows the user to set it up.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jeder Helfer ist standardmäßig deaktiviert. Schalten Sie einen ein, um ihn einzurichten."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "각 도우미는 기본적으로 꺼져 있습니다. 설정하려면 하나를 켜세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "По умолчанию каждый помощник отключен. Включите один из них, чтобы настроить его."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个助手默认都是关闭的。开启其中一个以进行设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個助手默認都是關閉的。開啓其中一個以進行設置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each item runs once, even after a restart" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jedes Element läuft einmal, auch nach einem Neustart"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "각 항목은 다시 시작한 후에도 한 번만 실행됩니다"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Каждый элемент запускается один раз, даже после перезапуска"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每个项目只运行一次，重启后也是如此"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每個項目只執行一次，重新啟動後也是如此"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line is matched literally — no regex needed. Special characters are escaped for you." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the text field where the user enters multiple terms for a \"Terms\" rule.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Each line is matched literally — no regex needed. Special characters are escaped for you."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 줄은 문자 그대로 일치합니다. 정규식이 필요하지 않습니다. 특수 문자는 자동으로 이스케이프됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждая строка сопоставляется буквально — регулярное выражение не требуется. Специальные символы экранируются для вас."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行均按字面内容进行匹配——无需正则表达式。特殊字符将自动为你转义。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行均按字面內容進行匹配——無需正則表達式。特殊字符將自動爲您轉義。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each message runs this automation once, even after a restart. A new automation starts with the next message that arrives." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jede Nachricht führt diese Automation einmal aus, auch nach einem Neustart. Eine neue Automation beginnt mit der nächsten eintreffenden Nachricht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "각 메시지는 다시 시작한 후에도 이 자동화를 한 번만 실행합니다. 새 자동화는 다음에 도착하는 메시지부터 시작합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Каждое письмо запускает эту автоматизацию один раз, даже после перезапуска. Новая автоматизация начинает со следующего письма."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
