    },
    "Each run asks before handing a task to another agent. Scheduled and event runs nobody watches stop at that step until this is on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Lauf fragt, bevor er eine Aufgabe an einen anderen Agenten übergibt. Geplante und ereignisgesteuerte Läufe ohne Zuschauer halten bei diesem Schritt an, bis dies aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each run asks before handing a task to another agent. Scheduled and event runs nobody watches stop at that step until this is on."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 실행은 다른 에이전트에게 작업을 넘기기 전에 묻습니다. 아무도 지켜보지 않는 예약 및 이벤트 실행은 이 옵션을 켤 때까지 해당 단계에서 멈춥니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Каждый запуск спрашивает, прежде чем передать задачу другому агенту. Запуски по расписанию и событиям, за которыми никто не следит, останавливаются на этом шаге, пока это не включено."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次运行在把任务交给其他智能体前都会询问。无人值守的定时和事件运行会停在该步骤，直到开启此项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次執行在把任務交給其他智能體前都會詢問。無人看管的排程和事件執行會停在該步驟，直到開啟此項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each runs with its own setup: its models and keys are bound there, not here. The hosts and tools it reaches are counted below." : {

    },
    "Each script that changes anything is shown for your approval before it runs. Read-only scripts run automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes Skript, das etwas ändert, wird dir vor dem Ausführen zur Bestätigung angezeigt. Rein lesende Skripte laufen automatisch."
