    "In %@, " : {
      "comment" : "A prompt for an open-ended action in an Architect chat.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "In %@, change the form so it asks for " : {
      "comment" : "A prompt for an Architect chat that edits a saved workflow. The argument is the name of the workflow.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "In %@, change the result so it " : {
      "comment" : "A prompt for an Architect chat action that changes the result of a workflow. The argument is the name of the workflow.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "In %@, run the steps on " : {
      "comment" : "A prompt for an Architect chat that edits a saved workflow. The argument is the name of the workflow.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "In chat, you get an approval card before anything is sent. For scheduled runs, posts wait in the Outbox for your approval." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the \"confirm\" mode of an outbound binding.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Im Chat erhältst du vor jedem Senden eine Genehmigungskarte. Bei geplanten Läufen warten Posts im Postausgang auf deine Genehmigung."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "채팅에서는 전송 전에 승인 카드가 표시됩니다. 예약 실행의 경우 게시물이 발신함에서 승인을 기다립니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В чате перед отправкой появляется карточка одобрения. Для запусков по расписанию посты ждут вашего одобрения в исходящих."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中，发送任何内容前都会显示批准卡片。对于计划任务运行，发帖会在发件箱中等待你的批准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中，傳送任何內容前都會顯示核准卡片。對於排程執行，發文會在寄件匣中等待您的核准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Google Takeout, select My Activity → Gemini Apps and create the export. The zip contains MyActivity.json." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wählen Sie in Google Takeout „Meine Aktivitäten“ → „Gemini Apps“ und erstellen Sie den Export. Die Zip-Datei enthält MyActivity.json."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
