    "Keep one phrase instead of two: your Osaurus recovery phrase will restore sync too. This Mac keeps its chats." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Phrase statt zwei: Deine Osaurus-Wiederherstellungsphrase stellt dann auch Sync wieder her. Dieser Mac behält seine Chats."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "문구 두 개 대신 하나만 보관하세요. Osaurus 복구 문구로 동기화도 복원됩니다. 이 Mac의 채팅은 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Храните одну фразу вместо двух: фраза восстановления Osaurus будет восстанавливать и синхронизацию. Этот Mac сохранит свои чаты."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只需保管一个短语而不是两个：你的 Osaurus 恢复短语也能恢复同步。此 Mac 会保留它的聊天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep only the newest per conversation" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
