    "Let agents post to write-allowlisted chats through Messages.app. Requires Messages Automation; the global Sending switch in Channels must also be on." : {
      "comment" : "Toggle to allow agents to post to write-allowlisted chats through Messages.app. Requires Messages Automation; the global Sending switch in Channels must also be on.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agenten dürfen über Messages.app in schreibfreigegebene Chats posten. Erfordert die Messages-Automation; der globale Senden-Schalter unter „Kanäle“ muss ebenfalls aktiviert sein."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트가 Messages.app을 통해 쓰기 허용 채팅에 게시할 수 있게 합니다. 메시지 자동화 권한이 필요하며, 채널의 전역 전송 스위치도 켜져 있어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Разрешить агентам писать в чаты из списка записи через Messages.app. Требуется автоматизация «Сообщений»; глобальный переключатель отправки в разделе «Каналы» также должен быть включён."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许智能体通过 Messages.app 向可写允许列表中的聊天发帖。需要“信息”自动化权限；“频道”中的全局发送开关也必须打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允許智能體透過 Messages.app 向可寫允許列表中的聊天發文。需要「訊息」自動化權限；「頻道」中的全域傳送開關也必須開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let agents post to write-allowlisted chats through the linked account. The global Sending switch in Channels must also be on." : {
