    "No release digests are pinned in this build. Build the helper locally with `make wa-helper` and point OSAURUS_WA_PATH at build/osaurus-wa (DEBUG builds), or run an app bundle with the helper sealed inside." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the WhatsApp helper when no release digests are pinned in the build.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In diesem Build sind keine Release-Digests verankert. Baue den Helfer lokal mit `make wa-helper` und richte OSAURUS_WA_PATH auf build/osaurus-wa (DEBUG-Builds), oder starte ein App-Bundle mit eingesiegeltem Helfer."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 빌드에는 릴리스 다이제스트가 고정되어 있지 않습니다. `make wa-helper`로 헬퍼를 로컬 빌드한 뒤 OSAURUS_WA_PATH를 build/osaurus-wa로 지정하거나(DEBUG 빌드), 헬퍼가 내장된 앱 번들을 실행하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В этой сборке не закреплены дайджесты релиза. Соберите помощник локально командой `make wa-helper` и укажите OSAURUS_WA_PATH на build/osaurus-wa (сборки DEBUG) либо запустите пакет приложения со встроенным помощником."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此构建未固定发布摘要。请使用 `make wa-helper` 在本地构建辅助程序，并将 OSAURUS_WA_PATH 指向 build/osaurus-wa（DEBUG 构建），或运行内置该辅助程序的应用包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
