            "value" : "關閉意味着進階搜尋在剩餘積分用完後停止；其他所有搜尋使用內置源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off uses ordinary autoregressive decoding. On uses a compatible bundled drafter (DSpark, Uno or DFlash 2), a selected DFlash 2 drafter, or adaptive native MTP when supported. Ineligible requests continue with ordinary decoding; see Speculative Decoding settings for the resolved reason. Sampling stays unchanged." : {

    },
    "Off uses ordinary decoding. On requests adaptive drafting without changing sampling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus verwendet reguläre Dekodierung. Ein nutzt adaptive Entwürfe ohne Änderung des Samplings."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "끔은 일반 디코딩을 사용합니다. 켬은 샘플링을 변경하지 않고 적응형 초안 생성을 요청합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выкл. использует обычное декодирование. Вкл. включает адаптивные черновики без изменения сэмплирования."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭使用普通解码。开启请求自适应推测生成，不改变采样设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, agents see only the sender, subject and a short preview." : {

    },
    "Off: callers not on this Mac must use Secure Channel or get 426. On: the secret alone is enough — trusted LAN only." : {

    },
    "Off: callers that are not on this Mac must use Secure Channel (end-to-end encrypted) or they receive 426. On: the shared secret alone authenticates them — use only on trusted networks such as a LAN n8n host." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus: Aufrufer, die nicht auf diesem Mac laufen, müssen Secure Channel (Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselt) verwenden, sonst erhalten sie 426. An: Das gemeinsame Geheimnis allein authentifiziert sie – nur in vertrauenswürdigen Netzwerken wie einem n8n-Host im LAN verwenden."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "끔: 이 Mac 외부의 호출자는 Secure Channel(종단 간 암호화)을 사용해야 하며, 그렇지 않으면 426을 받습니다. 켬: 공유 시크릿만으로 인증합니다. LAN의 n8n 호스트처럼 신뢰할 수 있는 네트워크에서만 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выкл.: вызывающие не с этого Mac должны использовать Secure Channel (сквозное шифрование), иначе получат 426. Вкл.: их аутентифицирует только общий секрет — используйте лишь в доверенных сетях, например для хоста n8n в локальной сети."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭：不在这台 Mac 上的调用方必须使用 Secure Channel（端到端加密），否则会收到 426。开启：仅凭共享密钥即可认证——仅在可信网络（例如局域网中的 n8n 主机）中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
