    "Osaurus continuously asks Telegram for new messages while the app runs (long polling). Turn this off only if another program polls the same bot." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the \"Receive Messages\" setting, explaining that it controls whether Osaurus continuously asks Telegram for new messages while the app is running.",
