    "Push the selected agent's sanitized reply as soon as it finishes. Global writes and the conversation allowlist still apply." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sendet die bereinigte Antwort des gewählten Agenten, sobald sie fertig ist. Globale Schreibrechte und die Unterhaltungs-Allowlist gelten weiterhin."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "선택한 에이전트의 정제된 응답을 완료 즉시 푸시합니다. 전역 쓰기 설정과 대화 허용 목록이 계속 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отправлять очищенный ответ выбранного агента сразу по завершении. Глобальные записи и список разрешённых бесед по-прежнему действуют."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在所选智能体完成后立即推送其经过净化的回复。全局写入设置和对话允许列表仍然适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Push to your phone. Delivery isn't available yet; your phone's token is kept for it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
