    "Read lets agents see a channel, Write lets them post there." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the read and write permissions for a channel.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Read lets agents see a chat, Write lets them post there, and Allow marks whose messages are handled. Manual ID fields are under Advanced." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Telegram settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Read lets agents see a chat, Write lets them post there, and the sender allowlist marks whose messages are handled. Manual IDs are under Advanced." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the sender allowlist.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Lesen“ lässt Agenten einen Chat sehen, „Schreiben“ lässt sie dort posten, und die Absender-Zulassungsliste bestimmt, wessen Nachrichten verarbeitet werden. Manuelle IDs findest du unter „Erweitert“."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "읽기는 에이전트가 채팅을 볼 수 있게 하고, 쓰기는 게시할 수 있게 하며, 발신자 허용 목록은 누구의 메시지를 처리할지 표시합니다. 수동 ID는 고급 설정에 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«Чтение» позволяет агентам видеть чат, «Запись» — писать в него, а список разрешённых отправителей определяет, чьи сообщения обрабатываются. Ручные идентификаторы — в разделе «Дополнительно»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“读”让智能体查看聊天，“写”让它们在其中发帖，发送者允许列表标记处理谁的消息。手动 ID 请见“高级”设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「讀」讓智能體查看聊天，「寫」讓它們在其中發文，傳送者允許列表標記處理誰的訊息。手動 ID 請見「進階」設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
