    "Receiving is not running. Add a bot token, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it." : {
      "comment" : "Hint text in the \"Telegram receive\" section of the settings view when receiving is not running.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Receiving is not running. Add a bot token, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Receiving is not running. Add a bot token, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Receiving is not running. Add a bot token, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收未运行。添加机器人令牌，打开接收消息，然后添加可读聊天和授权发送者以启动它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收未運行。新增機器人令牌，開啟接收訊息，然後新增可讀聊天和授權傳送者以啓動它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving is not running. Verify the helper and Full Disk Access, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it." : {
      "comment" : "Hint text displayed when the iMessage receive transport is not running.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Empfang läuft nicht. Prüfe den Helfer und den vollständigen Festplattenzugriff, aktiviere „Nachrichten empfangen“ und füge dann lesbare Chats und autorisierte Absender hinzu, um ihn zu starten."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수신이 실행되고 있지 않습니다. 도우미와 전체 디스크 접근 권한을 확인하고 메시지 수신을 켠 다음, 읽기 가능한 채팅과 승인된 발신자를 추가하여 시작하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Приём не запущен. Проверьте помощника и полный доступ к диску, включите «Приём сообщений», затем добавьте доступные для чтения чаты и авторизованных отправителей, чтобы запустить его."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收未在运行。请核实辅助程序和完全磁盘访问权限，打开“接收消息”，然后添加可读聊天和授权发送者以启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收未在執行。請核實輔助程式和完全磁盤訪問權限，開啟「接收訊息」，然後新增可讀聊天和授權傳送者以啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving is not running. Verify the helper and QR link, turn on Receive Messages, then add readable chats and authorized senders to start it." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a WhatsApp channel settings view when the WhatsApp receive transport is not running.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Empfang läuft nicht. Prüfe den Helfer und die QR-Verknüpfung, aktiviere „Nachrichten empfangen“ und füge dann lesbare Chats und autorisierte Absender hinzu, um ihn zu starten."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수신이 실행되고 있지 않습니다. 헬퍼와 QR 연결을 확인하고 메시지 수신을 켠 다음, 읽기 가능한 채팅과 승인된 발신자를 추가하여 시작하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Приём не запущен. Проверьте помощник и привязку по QR, включите «Получать сообщения», затем добавьте читаемые чаты и авторизованных отправителей, чтобы запустить его."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收未运行。请检查辅助程序和二维码关联，开启“接收消息”，然后添加可读聊天和已授权发送者以启动接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving is off — send-only setup. Agents can post to writable chats but will not see or reply to incoming iMessages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Empfang ist aus — reine Sende-Einrichtung. Agenten können in beschreibbare Chats posten, sehen eingehende iMessages aber nicht und antworten nicht darauf."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수신이 꺼져 있습니다 — 전송 전용 설정입니다. 에이전트는 쓰기 가능한 채팅에 게시할 수 있지만 수신 iMessage를 보거나 답장하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Приём выключен — конфигурация только для отправки. Агенты могут писать в доступные для записи чаты, но не видят входящие iMessage и не отвечают на них."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收已关闭——仅发送设置。智能体可以向可写聊天发帖，但不会看到或回复传入的 iMessage。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收已關閉——僅傳送設定。智能體可以向可寫聊天發文，但不會看到或回覆傳入的 iMessage。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving is off — send-only setup. Agents can post to writable chats but will not see or reply to incoming WhatsApp messages." : {
