    "Repos outside mlx-community must advertise an MLX-native artifact family in the repo name, such as MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ, or TurboQuant." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when a Hugging Face repo is found but is not MLX-compatible.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Repos außerhalb von mlx-community müssen im Repo-Namen eine MLX-native Artefaktfamilie angeben, z. B. MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ oder TurboQuant."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mlx-community 외부의 리포지토리는 리포지토리 이름에 MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ 또는 TurboQuant와 같은 MLX 네이티브 에셋 제품군을 명시해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Репозитории вне mlx-community должны указывать в имени семейство MLX-совместимых артефактов, например MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ или TurboQuant."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mlx-community 之外的仓库必须在仓库名称中标明 MLX 原生工件系列，例如 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 或 TurboQuant。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mlx-community 之外的倉庫必須在倉庫名稱中標明 MLX 原生工件系列，例如 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 或 TurboQuant。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
