    "Set it up on this Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Button title to add a workflow template to the current Mac.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Set only for %@; runs without an agent need a shared value" : {
      "comment" : "Workflow keys (credentials) UI.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set only for %@; runs without an agent need a shared value"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set per agent in the agent's Sandbox settings. When agents with different settings share the sandbox, it filters each one's web traffic separately and blocks other connections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird pro Agent in dessen Sandbox-Einstellungen festgelegt. Wenn sich Agenten mit unterschiedlichen Einstellungen die Sandbox teilen, filtert sie den Webverkehr jedes Agenten separat und blockiert andere Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "각 에이전트의 샌드박스 설정에서 에이전트별로 지정합니다. 설정이 다른 에이전트들이 샌드박스를 함께 쓰면, 각 에이전트의 웹 트래픽을 따로 필터링하고 다른 연결은 차단합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Задаётся для каждого агента в его настройках песочницы. Когда агенты с разными настройками используют одну песочницу, она фильтрует веб-трафик каждого отдельно и блокирует другие подключения."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个智能体的沙盒设置中分别设置。当设置不同的智能体共用沙盒时，沙盒会分别过滤每个智能体的网页流量，并阻止其他连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set the relay URL as the phone number's messaging or voice webhook (HTTP POST) and paste the account's Auth Token into the automation. Twilio signs the public address, so the relay URL is required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege die Relay-URL als Messaging- oder Voice-Webhook (HTTP POST) der Telefonnummer fest und füge das Auth Token des Kontos in die Automatisierung ein. Twilio signiert die öffentliche Adresse, daher ist die Relay-URL erforderlich."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "중계 URL을 전화번호의 메시지 또는 음성 웹훅(HTTP POST)으로 설정하고 계정의 Auth Token을 자동화에 붙여 넣으세요. Twilio는 공개 주소에 서명하므로 중계 URL이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Укажите URL ретранслятора как вебхук сообщений или голоса (HTTP POST) для номера и вставьте Auth Token аккаунта в автоматизацию. Twilio подписывает публичный адрес, поэтому нужен URL ретранслятора."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将中继 URL 设为该电话号码的短信或语音 Webhook（HTTP POST），并把账户的 Auth Token 粘贴到自动化中。Twilio 会对公开地址签名，因此必须使用中继 URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set the room directly if it doesn't appear in the list above." : {
      "comment" : "Hint for the room ID field.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lege den Raum direkt fest, wenn er oben in der Liste fehlt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "위 목록에 룸이 없으면 직접 설정하세요."
