    "The drafter must match the target model. A compatible selected or bundled DFlash 2 or DSpark drafter takes priority over native MTP. Incompatible folders are ignored; the resolved model state is shown below." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Drafter muss zum Zielmodell passen. Ein kompatibler ausgewählter oder mitgelieferter DFlash-2- oder DSpark-Drafter hat Vorrang vor nativem MTP. Inkompatible Ordner werden ignoriert; der tatsächlich verwendete Modellstatus wird unten angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The drafter must match the target model. A compatible selected or bundled DFlash 2 or DSpark drafter takes priority over native MTP. Incompatible folders are ignored; the resolved model state is shown below."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "초안 모델은 대상 모델과 일치해야 합니다. 호환되는 선택된 또는 번들 DFlash 2나 DSpark 초안 모델이 네이티브 MTP보다 우선합니다. 호환되지 않는 폴더는 무시되며 실제 모델 상태는 아래에 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Черновая модель должна соответствовать целевой модели. Совместимый выбранный или встроенный DFlash 2 либо DSpark имеет приоритет перед нативным MTP. Несовместимые папки игнорируются; фактическое состояние модели показано ниже."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "草稿模型必须与目标模型匹配。兼容的已选或内置 DFlash 2 或 DSpark 草稿模型优先于原生 MTP。不兼容的文件夹会被忽略；实际模型状态显示在下方。"
          }
        }
      }
