        }
      }
    },
    "The reply stayed in Osaurus because Reply Automatically is off. Turn it on in the channel settings to post replies back." : {
      "comment" : "Guidance in the inbound activity list explaining why an agent reply was not posted back to the channel.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Antwort blieb in Osaurus, weil „Reply Automatically“ deaktiviert ist. Aktivieren Sie die Option in den Kanaleinstellungen, um Antworten zurückzusenden."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reply Automatically가 꺼져 있어 응답이 Osaurus에 남아 있습니다. 채널 설정에서 켜면 응답이 채널로 전송됩니다."
