    "This agent and Server Concurrent Sessions share one configured local limit. Existing engine work and the memory check can queue or split it into smaller waves at run time. Different local models run one model at a time. Remote subagents use the separate remote limit and run concurrently." : {

    },
    "This agent doesn't reply on any channel yet. Open a connected channel in Channels settings and choose this agent under “Reply to incoming messages”." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when an agent has no",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Agent antwortet noch auf keinem Kanal. Öffne einen verbundenen Kanal in den Kanal-Einstellungen und wähle diesen Agenten unter „Auf eingehende Nachrichten antworten“."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 에이전트는 아직 어떤 채널에서도 답장하지 않습니다. 채널 설정에서 연결된 채널을 열고 “수신 메시지에 답장”에서 이 에이전트를 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Этот агент пока не отвечает ни на одном канале. Откройте подключённый канал в настройках каналов и выберите этого агента в разделе «Отвечать на входящие сообщения»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此智能体尚未在任何频道回复。请在“频道”设置中打开已连接的频道，并在“回复传入消息”下选择此智能体。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此智能體尚未在任何頻道回覆。請在「頻道」設定中打開已連接的頻道，並在「回覆傳入訊息」下選擇此智能體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This agent gets its own isolated browser profile. View sessions and sign-in status in Settings → Browser." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote explaining the purpose of the browser-use capability.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
