          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conversation is close to the model's context limit. Osaurus can summarize the older messages with a model of your choice, so the chat can continue with full awareness of what happened — your visible transcript is never changed." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how context compaction works.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "this copy of Osaurus is missing the bundled part that connects them" : {
      "comment" : "The reason for the \"architect tools unavailable\" message.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "This decides which URL the pairing code carries, whether n8n needs Relay to reach this Mac, and whether the connection is end-to-end encrypted." : {

    },
    "This delegation's chat is no longer available." : {

    },
    "This deletes everything in this Space, including its chats, agents, settings, and saved keys, then restarts Osaurus into setup. Other Spaces are not affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Dadurch wird alles in diesem Space gelöscht, einschließlich Chats, Agenten, Einstellungen und gespeicherter Schlüssel. Danach startet Osaurus mit der Einrichtung neu. Andere Spaces sind nicht betroffen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "이 스페이스의 채팅, 에이전트, 설정, 저장된 키를 포함한 모든 항목이 삭제되고 Osaurus가 설정 화면으로 다시 시작됩니다. 다른 스페이스에는 영향을 주지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Всё в этом пространстве, включая чаты, агентов, настройки и сохранённые ключи, будет удалено, после чего Osaurus перезапустится с настройкой. Другие пространства не затрагиваются."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "这将删除此空间中的所有内容，包括聊天、智能体、设置和已保存的密钥，然后 Osaurus 将重新启动并进入设置向导。其他空间不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "這將刪除此空間中的所有內容，包括聊天、智能體、設定和已儲存的金鑰，然後 Osaurus 將重新啟動並進入設定流程。其他空間不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the on-disk model (~2.8 GB). The Privacy Filter stops detecting until you re-download it." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in a confirmation alert when the user confirms they want to remove the Privacy Filter model.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies löscht das auf der Festplatte gespeicherte Modell (~2,8 GB). Der Datenschutzfilter erkennt nichts mehr, bis du es erneut herunterlädst."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "디스크의 모델(~2.8GB)이 삭제됩니다. 모델을 다시 다운로드할 때까지 개인정보 필터 감지가 중지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При этом модель на диске будет удалена (~2,8 GB). Фильтр конфиденциальности перестанет обнаруживать, пока вы не загрузите его повторно."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将删除磁盘上的模型（约 2.8 GB）。在你重新下载之前，隐私过滤器将停止检测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這將刪除磁盤上的模型（約 2.8 GB）。在你重新下載之前，隱私過濾器將停止檢測。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the on-disk model. Detection for it stops until you re-download." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This deletes the on-disk model. Detection for it stops until you re-download."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
