            "value" : "當您添加積分或使用Osaurus路由器模型時，它會連同金額顯示在這裡。如果這臺 Mac 提出了請求，您可以跳轉到聊天或 Insights。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you ask in chat, Osaurus may start this workflow on its own." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the \"Run for me\" checkbox.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "When you come back to this Mac after this Mac answered a chat from your iPhone, that chat opens in front." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du zu diesem Mac zurückkommst, nachdem er einen Chat von deinem iPhone beantwortet hat, öffnet sich dieser Chat im Vordergrund."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac이 iPhone의 채팅에 응답한 뒤 이 Mac으로 돌아오면 해당 채팅이 앞에 열립니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
