        }
      }
    },
    "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "When you turn it on for an agent, Browser Use lets that agent browse the web for you — navigating pages, reading content, filling forms, and working through a goal step by step, with every action shown in a live feed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当你为智能体开启浏览器使用时，该智能体可以为你浏览网页 — 导航页面、阅读内容、填写表单并逐步完成目标，每个操作都在实时动态中显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當你為智能體開啟瀏覽器使用時，該智能體可以為你瀏覽網頁 — 導航頁面、閱讀內容、填寫表單並逐步完成目標，每個操作都在即時動態中顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you turn it on for an agent, Computer Use lets that agent operate macOS apps for you — working through a goal step by step and showing every action in a live feed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn Sie es für einen Agenten aktivieren, lässt Computer Use diesen Agenten macOS-Apps für Sie betreiben, indem er ein Ziel Schritt für Schritt durcharbeitet und jede Aktion in einem Live-Feed anzeigt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트에 대해 이 기능을 켜면 컴퓨터 제어 기능을 통해 해당 에이전트가 사용자를 대신하여 macOS 앱을 조작할 수 있습니다. 단계별로 목표를 수행하며 모든 작업을 실시간 피드에 표시합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когда вы включаете эту функцию для агента, «Использование компьютера» позволяет этому агенту управлять приложениями macOS для вас, шаг за шагом достигая цели и показывая каждое действие в прямой трансляции."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为智能体开启此功能后，电脑操控即可让该智能体替你操作 macOS 应用程序——它会分步骤完成目标，并在实时动态中展示每一个动作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "爲智能體開啓此功能後，電腦操作即可讓該智能體替您操作 macOS 應用程序——它會分步驟完成目標，並在實時動態中展示每一個動作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you use an Osaurus Router model, each request shows up here with its cost and tokens. If this Mac made the request, you can jump to the chat or Insights." : {
