    "Workflows nest at most %lld deep; this call would go deeper." : {
      "comment" : "Auto-extracted format-string key (Apple String.LocalizationValue canonical form).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workflows nest at most %lld deep; this call would go deeper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workflows read the folders you choose, do their work in the sandbox, and save results where they say. Each one lists what it reads and saves before you run it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workflows lesen die von dir gewählten Ordner, arbeiten in der Sandbox und speichern Ergebnisse dort, wo sie es angeben. Jeder zeigt vor dem Start, was er liest und speichert."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "워크플로는 선택한 폴더를 읽고, 샌드박스에서 작업하고, 안내한 위치에 결과를 저장합니다. 실행 전에 각 워크플로가 읽고 저장하는 항목을 보여 줍니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Рабочие процессы читают выбранные вами папки, работают в песочнице и сохраняют результаты туда, куда указано. Перед запуском каждый показывает, что он читает и сохраняет."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作流会读取你选择的文件夹，在沙盒中完成工作，并把结果保存到它们说明的位置。每个工作流在运行前都会列出它读取和保存的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
